---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Terms and conditions for accessing the Assamese Manuscript Archive digital heritage platform and Samaguri Satra cultural resources."
  keywords="terms of use, terms and conditions, Assamese Manuscript Archive, Samaguri Satra, digital archive usage, research terms"
>
  <div class="py-28 px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-24 lg:px-40 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-ink font-medium mb-4">
        Terms &amp; Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body text-sm text-muted">
        Last Updated: September 30, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-body leading-relaxed bg-[var(--color-bg-elevated)] p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--color-hairline)] shadow-sm">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or utilizing the digital platform of the <strong>Assamese Manuscript Archive</strong> (https://assammanuscriptarchive.com), you acknowledge and agree to abide by these terms and conditions. The platform serves as an open educational and cultural repository dedicated to Vaishnavite manuscripts, traditional art, and the living heritage of Samaguri Satra.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">2. Permitted Use</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">Users are granted non-exclusive permission to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>Browse, view, and read digital folios, catalog descriptions, and transcripts for academic, research, and non-commercial educational purposes.</li>
          <li>Listen to the multilingual audio guide narrations provided for cultural enrichment.</li>
          <li>Cite and reference material with proper scholarly attribution as described in our Copyright &amp; Citation guidelines.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">3. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">The following actions are strictly prohibited:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>Bulk scraping or unauthorized automated harvesting of high-resolution cultural assets for commercial redistribution.</li>
          <li>Misrepresenting digital manuscript images or removing institutional watermarks and attribution.</li>
          <li>Attempting to compromise the security, infrastructure, or administrative endpoints of this archive.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">4. Intellectual Property &amp; Sacred Cultural Heritage</h2>
        <p>
          All manuscript folios, artifacts, and photographs presented on this platform represent sacred Vaishnavite heritage preserved within the custody of Samaguri Satra. Digital preservation is conducted in strict compliance with cultural protocols. Commercial exploitation without explicit prior written authorization from Samaguri Satra and project authorities is prohibited.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          While every care is taken to ensure the historical accuracy of catalog records and translations, materials are provided for scholarly study "as is." Girijananda Chowdhury University and Samaguri Satra disclaim liability for unintentional typographical or interpretive discrepancies.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
